stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disconnected : initial
    Disconnected --> PendingOAuth : oauth-start called\nstate nonce stored
    PendingOAuth --> Connected : callback received\nstate valid + not expired\ntoken stored
    PendingOAuth --> Disconnected : state missing / expired / mismatch\n→ 400 error
    Disconnected --> PendingCLI : cli oauth-start\nsubprocess spawned
    PendingCLI --> Connected : whoami exits 0\nusername stored
    PendingCLI --> Disconnected : TTL 5 min exceeded\n→ error status
    Disconnected --> Connected : PUT token saved
    Connected --> Disconnected : DELETE disconnect
    Connected --> Error : token revoked\nor platform rejects it
    Error --> Disconnected : DELETE disconnect
    Error --> Connected : PUT valid token